-- Horde group route 25-35 (5-man), continuing from the 21-25 guide.
--
-- 25-30 adds RestedXP's Hillsbrad (Tarren Mill), southern Barrens and Thousand
-- Needles quests to our Shadowfang Keep / Thousand Needles route. 30-35 is
-- Classic quest data (pfQuest database) routed in the order RestedXP's guides
-- use for these levels: Shimmering Flats, Razorfen Kraul, Stranglethorn Vale,
-- then Tarren Mill / Alterac / Arathi. WoW Forever's beta stopped at 30, so
-- 30-35 hasn't been checked against Forever yet: if an NPC doesn't offer a
-- quest, the guide skips it.
-- Optional detours (Skip skips the whole thing): Ruins of Lordaeron (25), Excavation Site (34).
-- Shared under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (adapted in part from RestedXP Guides).

